      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115ICT0.                                             00050000
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Sys_Charge_Type.  00070000
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00100000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160000
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170000
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180000
      *                                                                 00190000
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210000
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 00230000
      *    Set   R115ICT0-Version        To    True                     00240000
      *    Set   R115ICT0-In-Select      To    True                     00250000
      *    Move  &charge-type            To    R115ICT0-In-CT-Type      00260002
      *    Move  &regno                  To    R115ICT0-In-Regno        00261017
      *                                                                 00270000
      *    Call  'F115ICT0'              Using R115ICT0-Sys-Charge-Type 00280000
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00290000
      *    End-Call                                                     00300000
      *                                                                 00310000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00320000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00330000
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00340000
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00350000
      *                                                                 00360000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00370000
      *        ...not found...                                          00380000
      *                                                                 00390000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00400000
      *        ...found...                                              00410000
      *                                                                 00420000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00430000
      *                                                                 00440000
      *################################################################*00450000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00460000
      *------+---+-----------------------------------------------+----+ 00470000
      *200813!NDL! Added new GAR-account                         !LO18! 00480027
      *230801!NDL! Added new GL-account and regno                !LO18! 00480127
      *050101!NDL! Removed Paying_Pty, Min_Max, added Sort       !LT12! 00480227
      *160800!NDL! Added split-pct                               !LR02! 00480327
      *060999!HLR! Added two new GL accounts                     !LG10! 00481014
      *      !   ! Renamed GL-Account to GL-Coll-Acc             !    ! 00490013
      *190399!HLR! New copy area                                 !LG10! 00500013
      *################################################################*00510000
