               88  R115ICT0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00630000
               88  R115ICT0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00640000
               88  R115ICT0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00650000
               88  R115ICT0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00660000
               88  R115ICT0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00670000
               88  R115ICT0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00680000
      *                                                                 00690000
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), you may mask the type field,   00700000
      * like this: 'ABC*'. This will give you all rows with type        00710000
      * starting with 'ABC'.                                            00720000
      *                                                                 00730000
             10  R115ICT0-In-Key.                                       00740000
               15  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-Id      Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.00750003
               15  R115ICT0-In-Fin-Inst-No      Pic  X(18).             00760003
               15  R115ICT0-In-CT-Type          Pic  X(20).             00770003
               15  R115ICT0-In-Regno            Pic S9(04)       Comp.  00771017
      *                                                                 00780000
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        00790000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                00800000
      *                                                                 00810000
             10  R115ICT0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             00820000
               88  R115ICT0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     00830000
