      *                                                                 01150003
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    01160000
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            01170000
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   01180000
      * each Get-Next.                                                  01190000
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           01200000
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       01210000
      * that complies with your qualification.                          01220000
      *                                                                 01230000
             10  R115ICT0-Out-Accumulators.                             01240000
               15  R115ICT0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01250000
               15  R115ICT0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01260000
